.TH ceam-util-system 1  "system " 
.SH NAME
ceam\-util\-system \- system management
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBceam\-util system\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
system management
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-readonly(1)
Switch the root filesystem to read\-only mode (OverlayFS)
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-readwrite(1)
Switch the root filesystem back to read\-write mode
